          "text": "Which idea would you like to think about more?"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_a",
          "spans": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Does every dependence need a complete explanation?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_b",
          "spans": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Does adding another dependent thing settle the question?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_c",
          "spans": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "How do we preserve the comparison’s limits?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "reveal": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "These concern the reasoning’s grounds. Understanding them does not require declaring your agreement."
        }
      ],
      "visual": null
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b_u0_l04_10",
      "type": "teach",
      "eyebrow": null,
      "title": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "“What created the Creator?”"
        }
      ],
      "style": "standard",
      "visual": null,
      "evidence": null,
      "points": [
        {
          "point_id": "p_1",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l04_025",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The reasoning is not “everything needs a maker” followed by exempting a Creator from that statement."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "p_2",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l04_026",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The stated starting point is things dependent on others. We ask what explains that dependence."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "p_3",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l04_027",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Calling something dependent a “Creator” does not make it the final explanation we are seeking."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "p_4",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l04_028",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If the foundation truly is independent, asking what its dependence rests on assumes the dependence that description denies."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "p_5",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l04_029",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Establishing such a foundation and examining the reasoning’s conditions remain necessary. A name alone is insufficient."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b_u0_l04_11",
      "type": "exercise",
      "exercise": {
        "exercise_id": "ex_u0_l04_04",
        "type": "multiple_choice",
        "concept_ids": [
          "con_u0_independent_creator"
        ],
        "prompt": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Which answer represents the reasoning honestly?"
          }
        ],
        "time_limit_ms": null,
        "scoring": {
          "accuracy": true,
          "combo": true,
          "layer": "understand"
        },
        "framing": null,
        "payload": {
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt_a",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Everything has a maker, except whatever we arbitrarily choose."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_b",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Calling the lantern a Creator proves its independence."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_c",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "If dependence needs a final explanation, something dependent in the same way cannot complete it."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b_u0_l04_12",
      "type": "teach",
      "eyebrow": null,
      "title": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Attributes within the reasoning’s reach"
        }
      ],
      "style": "standard",
      "visual": null,
      "evidence": null,
      "points": [
        {
          "point_id": "p_1",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l04_031",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If an independent Creator explains these things, it would not need them to sustain its own existence."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "p_2",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l04_032",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It would need sufficient ability for the existence attributed to it, or it would not perform the explanatory role."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "p_3",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l04_033",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This is a limited step. It alone yields neither a name, appearance, message, nor every attribute of a Creator."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "p_4",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l04_034",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Lengthening the row or calling it endless does not by itself establish or disprove the answer."
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        },
        {
          "point_id": "p_5",
          "sentence": {
            "sentence_id": "s_u0_l04_035",
            "spans": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The question remains: has the dependence been explained, or only moved to another dependence?"
              }
            ],
            "source_ids": []
          },
          "visual_params": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
